{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>From this rock shall we bring out water for you.</b> Israel understood it literally — that is, how could it be that this rock should bring out water for you? And Moses intended to say: would you have imagined that from this rock we would bring out water for you, as was indeed done. And therefore HaShem was exacting with him, for he should have explained his words so that all would know explicitly that HaShem gives them water, but he did not speak with precision."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:18:46.331688941Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}